{"title":"Career roadmap · Visual Merchandiser","role":"Visual Merchandiser","summary":"A Visual Merchandiser creates and manages the visual presentation of products across stores, showrooms, windows, pop-ups and digital retail environments. The role combines fashion/luxury branding, consumer psychology, retail strategy, spatial presentation and commercial performance.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – Luxury / Fashion / Brand Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For BBA – Luxury / Fashion / Brand Management, this is a strong direct alignment."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Luxury/Fashion/Brand Management","Visual Merchandising Internship","VM Intern / Retail Visual Executive","Visual Merchandiser","Senior Visual Merchandiser","VM Manager","Regional/National VM Manager","Head of Visual Merchandising"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build fashion/luxury, retail, branding, styling, merchandising and visual-design skills. Complete 2–3 internships and a strong visual portfolio."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in fashion retail, luxury, window displays, store experience, digital VM or brand experience."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior VM, VM Manager, Retail Experience Manager or Brand Experience Manager."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead visual merchandising strategy across regions, store networks or international luxury/fashion brands."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Fashion + retail foundation"},{"text":"Fashion, retail and consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Retail brand analysis"},{"text"